            "line": 1671,
            "text": "theorem modifiedCoefficients_zero_fields {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hX : 0 ≤ p.1) (heta : |p.2| ≤ 1) :\n    (modifiedCoefficients W Q M).phi 0 p = W.axis.normalization * Q.f p ∧\n    (modifiedCoefficients W Q M).axial 0 p = Q.U p ∧\n    (modifiedCoefficients W Q M).pressure 0 p = Q.pressure p"
